# Fountainport Bell's enters trigger is independent of the Bell once it is on the stack (CR 113.7a, 608.2): with the trigger waiting,
# Bot1 pays {1} (from a Black Lotus) and sacrifices the Bell, drawing the top card (Lightning Bolt). The trigger then resolves
# regardless: the Island is found and put on top, and (a check on the library that follows) is the next card drawn on turn 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Fountainport Bell
Plains x5
Lightning Bolt
Island
Plains x6

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Fountainport Bell.Cast
Bot1.Pass
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Fountainport Bell.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Search(Island)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Fountainport Bell; Black Lotus
Bot1.Hand = Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains; Lightning Bolt; Island
